      "message": "I understand your concern.\nThis is call for enable / disable and it\u0027s not part of critical task so I am not to worried.\n\nCriticalNative is a 25 nanosecond cost, compared to 115 nano for a normal JNI call\n\nI do not know what I prefer...\nI like the encapsulation because I do not want the caller to think about what uid is using. Forgetting to use `UserHandle.getAppId` for example or sendind the wrong uid.\n\nBut in the same time, it\u0027s not an api and we are doing whatever we want so we can trust ourself to make it better !\n\nI may or may not upload a CL to change that depending on the star alignement 😊",
